flowchart TD
  sdk[Complete SDK quality and packaging checks] -->|authorized release| npm[Public SAGA source and npm packages]
  baseline[Dependency decision and Ansari baseline] --> server[Prepare MCP delivery migration]
  baseline --> view[Prepare core and Lit migration]
  destination[Verify destination layout and MIT obligations] --> candidate["One destination transplant candidate<br/>using pinned SAGA builds"]
  server --> candidate
  view --> candidate
  candidate --> checks["Pinned-candidate regressions<br/>resource compatibility and rollback"]
  candidate -->|authorized access| hosts["Required host runs and recorded evidence<br/>ChatGPT web, Claude web, Alexa+"]
  npm --> install["Clean destination checkout installs exact npm versions<br/>without private credentials"]
  candidate --> install
  checks --> merge["Destination CI and maintainer review<br/>control merge to develop"]
  hosts -->|required evidence| merge
  install -->|hard merge prerequisite| merge
  hosts -.-> acceptance["Captain signoff<br/>may remain pending"]
  baseline --> listingprep[Prepare listing materials in parallel]
  listingprep --> submit[Authorized host submission]
  hosts -->|qualified endpoint| submit
  submit --> listing[Host review and publication]
